# SageOS default Flatpaks — ADDITIONS on top of Bazzite's own first-boot set.
# Bazzite (KDE) already installs: Firefox, Haruna, Okular, Gwenview, KCalc,
# Filelight, Flatseal, Warehouse, Gear Lever, DistroShelf, ProtonUp-Qt, and
# the MangoHud / vkBasalt / OBSVkCapture Vulkan layers. Do not duplicate them.
#
# One Flathub ref per line; '#' starts a comment. Editing this file changes
# its hash, which re-triggers sageos-flatpak-setup.service on the next boot
# after the image update lands.

# Office (daily-driver requirement; Bazzite ships no office suite)
org.libreoffice.LibreOffice

# ── Phase 4 candidates (gaming compat launchers) — enable when Phase 4 lands ──
# com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl
# net.lutris.Lutris
# com.usebottles.bottles
